Igolanose used love of Valento and Cara to corrupt 
them. As the curse was put on Valento, Cara also fell 
without power as their souls were connected through 
the ring.

Now, by using the curse against Igolanose, they will 
be freed. As the soul connecting ring has been purified,
if you defeat Valento who is the centre of the curse, 
Cara will also naturally be freed by the purified 
ring.

Carry this ring, and defeat Valento.